### Registrar um CLIENT -> 201 (se o email já existir, retorna 409; pode ignorar)
POST {{host}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "client@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Login como CLIENT (guarda o token em "client_token")
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "client@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("client_token", response.body.token);
%}

### Criar rascunho (guarda o id em "solicitation_id") -> 201
POST {{host}}/solicitations
Authorization: Bearer {{client_token}}

> {%
    client.global.set("solicitation_id", response.body.id);
%}

### Submit com o rascunho vazio -> 400 com missingSteps [1,2,3] e fieldErrors
POST {{host}}/solicitations/{{solicitation_id}}/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{client_token}}

### Etapa 2 antes da etapa 1 -> 409
PUT {{host}}/solicitations/{{solicitation_id}}/steps/2
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{client_token}}

{
  "cep": "22785-275",
  "number": "25997",
  "complement": "CT George Helal"
}

### Etapa 1: dados básicos -> 200, currentStep 2
PUT {{host}}/solicitations/{{solicitation_id}}/steps/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{client_token}}

{
  "serviceType": "INSTALLATION",
  "title": "Instalar ar-condicionado",
  "description": "Instalação de um split na sala de estar do apartamento"
}

### Etapa 1 inválida (título curto) -> 400
PUT {{host}}/solicitations/{{solicitation_id}}/steps/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{client_token}}

{
  "serviceType": "INSTALLATION",
  "title": "ab",
  "description": "curta"
}

### Etapa 2 com CEP inexistente -> 400, currentStep continua 2
PUT {{host}}/solicitations/{{solicitation_id}}/steps/2
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{client_token}}

{
  "cep": "99999999",
  "number": "10"
}

### Etapa 2: endereço (rua, bairro, cidade e UF vêm do ViaCEP) -> 200, currentStep 3
PUT {{host}}/solicitations/{{solicitation_id}}/steps/2
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{client_token}}

{
  "cep": "22785-275",
  "number": "25997",
  "complement": "CT George Helal"
}

### Etapa 3: prioridade HIGH com valor abaixo de 100 -> 400
PUT {{host}}/solicitations/{{solicitation_id}}/steps/3
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{client_token}}

{
  "priority": "HIGH",
  "estimatedValue": 99.99,
  "termsAccepted": true
}

### Etapa 3: confirmação -> 200
PUT {{host}}/solicitations/{{solicitation_id}}/steps/3
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{client_token}}

{
  "priority": "MEDIUM",
  "preferredDate": "2030-01-15",
  "estimatedValue": 250.00,
  "termsAccepted": true
}

### Consultar a solicitação -> 200
GET {{host}}/solicitations/{{solicitation_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{client_token}}

### Solicitação inexistente -> 404
GET {{host}}/solicitations/999999
Authorization: Bearer {{client_token}}

### Submit -> 200, status SUBMITTED
POST {{host}}/solicitations/{{solicitation_id}}/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{client_token}}

### Editar depois do submit -> 409
PUT {{host}}/solicitations/{{solicitation_id}}/steps/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{client_token}}

{
  "serviceType": "INSPECTION",
  "title": "Outro título",
  "description": "Descrição nova com mais de vinte caracteres"
}

### Submit de novo -> 409
POST {{host}}/solicitations/{{solicitation_id}}/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{client_token}}

### Sem token -> 401
POST {{host}}/solicitations

### ADMIN não acessa as rotas do cliente -> 403 (rode o login do admin em users.http antes)
POST {{host}}/solicitations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
